00:00:26.269 --> 00:00:29.759
I'm not like a Joe Biden, you know, cheerleader.

00:00:29.759 --> 00:00:34.690
But he seems significantly energized by this
announcement.

00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:41.430
He spoke yesterday at North America's Building
Trades Union legislative conference, his first

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:44.980
speech since announcing the 2024 campaign.

00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:47.050
Standing ovations.

00:00:47.050 --> 00:00:49.550
Energy going after the maggots.

00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:50.550
